' ============================================================================
' SINGHA AI MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - ARCHITECTURE V2
' Self-contained PlantUML source; no external includes are required.
'
' Purpose
' - Multi-company Senior AI Manager coordinating staff, departments and projects.
' - Event-driven monitoring of WhatsApp, email, documents and operational systems.
' - Internally-owned double-entry accounting system (no QuickBooks dependency).
' - Human-controlled approvals for money, legal, HR and other sensitive actions.
'
' This file contains multiple diagrams. PlantUML renders each @startuml block as
' a separate diagram. Suggested output names are taken from each diagram ID.
' ============================================================================


' ============================================================================
' DIAGRAM 1 - ENTERPRISE SYSTEM CONTEXT
' ============================================================================
@startuml Singha_01_Enterprise_Context
title Singha AI Management System - Enterprise Context

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
