Webhooks --> Telemetry
Inngest --> Telemetry
ModelRouter --> Health
Postgres --> Health
Telemetry --> Health
Health --> Alerting
Postgres --> Backup
ObjectStore --> Backup
Secrets --> NextApp
Secrets --> Inngest

note right of DataPlatform
  Separate development, staging and production environments.
  Production data is never copied into development.
  Migrations are forward-only and tested before release.
end note

note bottom of Operations
  Monitor queue age, failed events, integration health,
  model latency/cost/schema errors, RLS failures,
  overdue approvals, backup age and suspicious access.
end note
@enduml


